WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.528
Hello! My name is Alex.

00:00:02.778 --> 00:00:05.243
Nice to meet you. My name is Léa.

00:00:05.493 --> 00:00:07.112
Do you live here?

00:00:07.362 --> 00:00:10.108
Yes, I live in Lyon. And you?

00:00:10.358 --> 00:00:13.949
I live in Paris. I am here for the weekend.
